WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.200
This programme was born out of a shared belief

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:04.800
that African fashion has so much to offer,

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:08.650
and that boubou in particular deserves to be explored

00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:11.700
beyond what we have traditionally known it to be.

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:15.440
So I’m going to have to develop the design a little bit more.

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:18.560
But yeah, I think I’m happy with what I have for now.

00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:21.500
I learned that you can have ideas,

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:25.680
but how to bring them to life is the problem.

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:28.440
I think it’s a way of pushing our creative minds

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:30.900
that you can think outside the box.

